# File: graf-shb-dark.prf

#
# This file defines special attr/char mappings for use in "graphics" mode
# with Shockbolt's 64x64 tiles, with dark-coloured background.
#
# Converted by Mogami from the dg32-assign of AngbandTK
# Additional work by Ivan Jekic (the.edge@Net.yu)
# Shockbolt's tiles by Raymond Gaustadnes
# Shockbolt tile conversion/placement by Blue Baron
# Additional work by PowerWyrm
#
# See "docs/customize.rst" and "src/ui-prefs.c" for more information.
#


